meta {
  name: Add bookmark
  type: http
  seq: 2
}

put {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/me/bookmarks/:pageNumber
  body: none
  auth: bearer
}

params:path {
  pageNumber: 1-604
}

auth:bearer {
  token: {{accessToken}}
}

docs {
  Replaces: user_bookmarks insert in useBookmarks (toggle-on path and the
  offline-queue replay).

  Authorization: caller's own bookmarks. Validation: page 1-604 (DB CHECK).

  MUST be idempotent (200 if the bookmark already exists, not an error):
  the client's offline queue replays queued inserts after reconnect and
  treats duplicate-insert as success (currently Postgres 23505 → "already
  applied"). A non-idempotent endpoint would wedge the replay loop.

  Response 200/201: the bookmark object.
}
